### 1. List candidates (CompanyAdmin/Recruiter/HiringManager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Create candidate (CompanyAdmin/Recruiter)
# @name createCandidate
POST {{baseUrl}}/candidates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-0123"
}

> {%
    if (response.body.id) {
        client.global.set("candidateId", response.body.id);
    }
%}

### 3. Get candidate detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/candidates/{{candidateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
